meta {
  name: 2. Create Escrow
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/escrows
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "buyer_id": "acc_buyer_001",
    "seller_id": "acc_seller_001",
    "arbiter_id": "acc_arbiter_001",
    "amount": 50000,
    "currency": "USD",
    "title": "MacBook Pro Purchase",
    "description": "Escrow agreement for 16-inch MacBook Pro M3 Max",
    "return_period_days": 5
  }
}

docs {
  **Create Escrow**: Initializes a multi-party escrow agreement between a Buyer, Seller, and neutral Arbiter with a 5-day return window rule. Deploys an Escrow Vault Account on the Google Cloud Universal Ledger (`acc_vault_<id>`) to hold escrowed funds.
}
